{"id":"malin","lemma":"malin","pos":"adj","rank":1170,"glosses":["malignant","smart and quick-thinking, and often tricksterish; cunning, crafty"],"ipa":"/ma.lɛ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/19/Fr-malin.ogg/Fr-malin.ogg.mp3","forms":{"feminine":"maligne","masculinePlural":"malins","femininePlural":"malignes"},"formAudio":{"maligne":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/58/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-maligne.wav","malins":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f1/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-malins.wav","malignes":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ae/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-malignes.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Le chien est malin.","en":"The dog is smart.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1095542","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"dog"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null]},{"text":"Nous sommes plus malins que ça.","en":"We're smarter than that.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"more / no longer"},null,{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"that"}]},{"text":"Il est plus malin que moi.","en":"He is more clever than me.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"more / no longer"},null,{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"me"}]},{"text":"Je ne suis pas si maligne.","en":"I'm not all that smart.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"am","l":"être"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"if, whether"},null]},{"text":"Tu es un garçon malin.","en":"You're a smart boy.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"are","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"boy"},null]}]}